WEBVTT

1
00:00:05.330 --> 00:00:08.650
Thank you so much, Sister Carmen Ligia.

2
00:00:08.790 --> 00:00:11.310
We want to send you a lovely message.

3
00:00:11.630 --> 00:00:12.990
Thank you so much.

4
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:16.530
[A few words are unclear.]

5
00:00:16.530 --> 00:00:20.450
We love you and all the sisters very much,

6
00:00:20.450 --> 00:00:23.670
and the whole La Presentación family.

7
00:00:24.090 --> 00:00:28.530
This Christmas, we want to celebrate
together,

8
00:00:29.270 --> 00:00:31.010
Christmas and the Night of the Little
Candles.

9
00:00:31.630 --> 00:00:33.550
And we want to sing Christmas prayers for
you.

10
00:00:34.250 --> 00:00:37.930
Come, come, come! Come into our souls,
Jesus.

11
00:00:38.090 --> 00:00:41.950
Come, come, come! Come into our souls,
Jesus.

12
00:00:42.130 --> 00:00:44.270
Come, come, come! Come into our souls.

13
00:00:44.870 --> 00:00:49.690
Do not delay so long, Jesus. Come, come,
come!

14
00:00:49.990 --> 00:00:51.810
Goodbye, La Presentación family!

15
00:00:51.810 --> 00:00:56.330
And especially Sister Carmen Ligia. Goodbye!

16
00:00:56.330 --> 00:00:59.650
This is a very special day of love and
peace,

17
00:01:00.150 --> 00:01:03.530
of happiness, and lots and lots of
happiness.

18
00:01:03.530 --> 00:01:06.190
A day of peace and being together as a
family

19
00:01:06.190 --> 00:01:09.010
during this week in December.

20
00:01:09.710 --> 00:01:14.390
We love you and wish you a Merry Christmas.

21
00:01:14.930 --> 00:01:17.750
Goodbye, Sister Carmen Ligia! Goodbye!

22
00:01:17.750 --> 00:01:20.500
Kisses to all the sisters!
